//@version=6
// Built-in indicator bundled with DegenView. Original work, GPL-3.0-only.
// On-Balance Volume: a running total that adds the bar's volume on an up close and subtracts it on
// a down close. Rising OBV with flat price means buyers are accumulating. A moving average of it
// is drawn as the signal.
indicator("OBV", overlay = false)

signalLength = input.int(21, "Signal length", minval = 1)

value = ta.obv

plot(value, "OBV", color = color.blue, linewidth = 2)
plot(ta.sma(value, signalLength), "Signal", color = color.orange)
